{'symbol': 'C', 'date': '2023-06-15 17:00:00', 'title': 'CITI TTS SELECTS PISMO TO ENRICH GLOBAL DEMAND DEPOSIT ACCOUNT SOLUTIONS', 'text': "NEW YORK & BRISTOL, ENGLAND--(BUSINESS WIRE)--CITI TREASURY AND TRADE SOLUTIONS (TTS) AND PISMO, THE NEXT-GEN BANKING AND PAYMENTS SOFTWARE COMPANY, JOINTLY ANNOUNCED THEIR RELATIONSHIP IN WHICH CITI WILL USE PISMO'S TECHNOLOGY PLATFORM TO HELP STRENGTHEN CITI'S CORPORATE DEMAND DEPOSIT ACCOUNTS (DDA), TO CLIENTS WORLDWIDE."}